cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use faultline in your work, please cite it."
title: faultline
abstract: >-
  Deterministic silent-failure testing for AI agents: break a tool's return (wrong, stale, empty,
  truncated data) and catch when the agent confidently does the wrong thing with no error — using a
  deterministic detector, no LLM judge.
type: software
authors:
